      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Data Routing & Visualization Engine\n\n**Trigger** → POST `/webhook/data-routing`\n\n### Payload Shape\n```json\n{\n  \"outputMode\": \"clean_data | charts_dashboard | full_intelligence\",\n  \"data\": [\n    { \"label\": \"Jan\", \"revenue\": 12000, \"profit\": 4200 }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Switch Routes\n| Route | Value | Target |\n|-------|-------|--------|\n| 0 | `clean_data` | Set node — structured export stub |\n| 1 | `charts_dashboard` | Code node — HTML + Chart.js |\n| 2 | `full_intelligence` | Both branches simultaneously |\n| 3 | *(unmatched)* | Fallback output (no-op) |\n\n### Model\ngpt-4o-mini (native dropdown — no custom ID)"
      },
      "id": "5498d745-5bd4-40f7-8003-5f50094b5689",
      "name": "Sticky Note 5498d745",
