    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Route 0 — Clean Data Exporter\n\nReceives `clean_data` or `full_intelligence` mode.\n\n**Set node** structures the sanitized payload:\n- `outputMode` — echoed from request\n- `records` — the raw data array\n- `recordCount` — length of the dataset\n- `status` — hardcoded `\"sanitized\"`\n- `exportedAt` — ISO timestamp\n\nWire this output to Google Sheets, a DB, or an HTTP endpoint."
      },
