        "content": "## Route 1 — HTML Dashboard Generator\n\nReceives `charts_dashboard` or `full_intelligence` mode.\n\n**Code node** returns:\n- `htmlDashboard` — full standalone HTML string\n- `dataPoints` — number of data records\n- `generatedAt` — ISO timestamp\n\nThe dashboard uses:\n- Tailwind CSS (CDN) for responsive layout\n- Chart.js (CDN) for interactive line graph\n- Dark theme with KPI summary cards\n\nSave `htmlDashboard` as `.html` and open in any browser.",
